<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka two-year treasury bonds oversubscribed.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka two-year treasury bonds oversubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's Central Bank said its auction of two-year treasury bonds on Thursday to raise 500 million rupees was heavily oversubscribed.</p>
<p>	  Amount offered:	500 million rupees</p>
<p>	  Bids received:	 1,325 million rupees</p>
<p>	  Amount accepted:     500 million rupees</p>
<p>	  Coupon rate:	   14 percent per year</p>
<p>	  Weighted avg yield:  14 percent per year</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
